#: src/campushallen/web/templates/account.html:18
msgid "Remove local connection data"
msgstr "Ta bort lokala anslutningsuppgifter"

#: src/campushallen/web/templates/account.html:18
msgid ""
"These actions never cancel Campushallen bookings. A request already in "
"flight cannot be recalled."
msgstr ""
"Dessa åtgärder avbokar aldrig pass hos Campushallen. Ett bokningsförsök "
"som redan skickats kan inte stoppas."

#: src/campushallen/web/templates/account.html:18
msgid "Disconnect or delete connection"
msgstr "Koppla från eller ta bort anslutningen"

#: src/campushallen/web/templates/account.html:19
msgid ""
"Disconnect removes saved credentials and tokens, keeping your rules and "
"history."
msgstr ""
"När du kopplar från tas sparade inloggningsuppgifter och anslutningen "
"bort lokalt. Regler och historik finns kvar."

#: src/campushallen/web/templates/account.html:19
msgid "I confirm disconnection"
msgstr "Jag bekräftar frånkopplingen"

#: src/campushallen/web/templates/account.html:19
msgid "Disconnect account"
msgstr "Koppla från konto"

#: src/campushallen/web/templates/account.html:20
msgid ""
"Delete removes this connection, its rules, credentials, snapshots, and "
"local booking history."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort anslutningen, dess regler, sparade inloggningsuppgifter, hämtade"
" pass och lokal bokningshistorik."

